{"data": {"Vayne": {"allytips": ["Tumble has many uses, but it cannot pass over walls.", "Condemn can be used to both pin targets to walls to ensure a kill, or to escape a pursuer.", "Don't go in first to a large teamfight. Wait for your teammates to initiate."], "blurb": "Shauna Vayne is a deadly, remorseless Demacian monster hunter, who has dedicated her life to finding and destroying the demon that murdered her family. Armed with a wrist-mounted crossbow and a heart full of vengeance, she is only truly happy when...", "enemytips": ["Vayne is fragile - turn the pressure up on her and she will be forced to play cautiously.", "Deny Vayne the opportunity to pin you against walls."], "id": "Vayne", "image": {"full": "Vayne.png", "group": "champion", "h": 48, "sprite": "champion4.png", "w": 48, "x": 336, "y": 96}, "info": {"attack": 10, "defense": 1, "difficulty": 8, "magic": 1}, "key": "67", "lore": "Shauna Vayne is a deadly, remorseless Demacian monster hunter, who has dedicated her life to finding and destroying the demon that murdered her family. Armed with a wrist-mounted crossbow and a heart full of vengeance, she is only truly happy when slaying practitioners or creations of the dark arts, striking from the shadows with a flurry of silver bolts.", "name": "Vayne", "partype": "Mana", "passive": {"description": "Vayne ruthlessly hunts evil-doers, gaining Move Speed when moving toward nearby enemy champions.", "image": {"full": "Vayne_NightHunter.png", "group": "passive", "h": 48, "sprite": "passive4.png", "w": 48, "x": 336, "y": 96}, "name": "Night Hunter"}, "recommended": [], "skins": [{"chromas": false, "id": "67000", "name": "default", "num": 0}, {"chromas": false, "id": "67001", "name": "Vindicator Vayne", "num": 1}, {"chromas": false, "id": "67002", "name": "Aristocrat Vayne", "num": 2}, {"chromas": true, "id": "67003", "name": "Dragonslayer Vayne", "num": 3}, {"chromas": false, "id": "67004", "name": "Heartseeker Vayne", "num": 4}, {"chromas": false, "id": "